Pherkad is the single source of truth for voice. Until 2026-09-01 this copy was 419 lines
against pherkad's 587 and held three features that existed nowhere else: the honest-X ban at
error level, the declared phrase exemption, and the rules-file exemption. All three are now
upstream, so this file is byte-identical to its source and the corpus lints the same as it
did before the swap.

Fix rules in pherkad, then run tools/sync-voicelint.sh here. Never edit this copy.


